Title:          SJGPlay
Description:    Audio CDPlayer with Lyrics
Summary:        Audio CDPlayer with Lyrics. Features syncronized lyrics & Karaoke! Easy lyric editor & syncronizer. Saves playlist for each CD. Big char display. Many display modes. Catalog/sort/print CD's and lyrics. Intro, repeat, button bars, waveform scope, freq analyzer, font editor, calendar, calculator, and screen saver. Supports SoundBlaster, multiple drives, 43/50-line screens, mouse and joystick. Now with SB Mixer and improved font support.
Keywords:       cdrom, music, player
